question_resolution_criteria:
This question will resolve as the Euro Area annual inflation in July 2025 as reported by Eurostat.

For clarity, this question considers the "All-items HICP" value, for the Euro Area, not the EU.

The relevant value will likely be reported on Eurostat's website similar to [previous reports.](https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/en/web/products-euro-indicators/w/2-19052025-ap)&#x20;
